WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:37.500
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:37.770 --> 01:43.060
[Shadow Punisher]

3
01:43.110 --> 01:43.729
[Divine Constable Tally]

4
01:43.729 --> 01:45.900
[Episode 24]

5
01:46.509 --> 01:47.310
Zexi.

6
01:47.310 --> 01:48.039
Yes, Your Highness.

7
01:48.039 --> 01:49.430
Make sure the Golden Dragon Pavilion is completely surrounded.

8
01:49.430 --> 01:50.509
If there are enemies,

9
01:50.509 --> 01:51.430
take them all down.

10
01:51.430 --> 01:51.950
Yes.

11
01:56.620 --> 01:58.110
[Golden Dragon Pavilion]

12
02:12.800 --> 02:13.730
Shadow puppets?

13
02:13.750 --> 02:14.640
These aren't like

14
02:14.640 --> 02:16.310
the shadow puppets we usually see.

15
02:16.310 --> 02:17.570
They're all soldiers.

16
02:18.360 --> 02:23.560
Flat hands, flat feet, a body flat as can be.

17
02:23.560 --> 02:24.240
Shadow puppets!

18
02:24.240 --> 02:28.630
-They are all shadow puppets! -Yet it claims to be human, not a shadow.

19
02:28.380 --> 02:29.660
[Embrace All, Integrate All]

20
02:28.630 --> 02:29.730
Shadow puppets can kill!

21
02:29.730 --> 02:31.210
-Is it -These shadow puppets can kill!

22
02:31.210 --> 02:34.670
-a puppet performing shadow play, -Attack! They are all fake!

23
02:34.760 --> 02:40.000
-or a shadow puppet wearing human skin? -Form ranks and counterattack!

24
02:35.140 --> 02:36.040
[Embrace All, Integrate All]

25
02:40.280 --> 02:40.850
Zhenzhu,

26
02:40.880 --> 02:42.840
go to the Yunding Pavilion and guard the Grand Heir Apparent.

27
02:42.840 --> 02:43.800
Leave this to me.

28
02:43.800 --> 02:44.430
Okay.

29
03:12.520 --> 03:13.310
Why are

30
03:13.310 --> 03:15.030
our own people fighting each other?

31
03:15.030 --> 03:15.840
Oh no,

32
03:16.560 --> 03:18.490
it's Liluo's illusion technique.

33
03:19.000 --> 03:20.760
The Dark Night is behind this again.

34
03:20.760 --> 03:23.000
[God of Calamity, Qiuyu]

35
03:24.430 --> 03:25.560
The God of Calamity,

36
03:26.030 --> 03:26.960
Qiuyu...

37
03:31.840 --> 03:32.770
Stop, all of you!

38
04:02.150 --> 04:03.520
Shadow puppet monster!

39
04:23.800 --> 04:25.040
The spirit channels flow;

40
04:25.040 --> 04:26.040
yin and yang shift unpredictably—

41
04:26.040 --> 04:26.830
break!

42
04:41.120 --> 04:41.830
Mr. Yan.

43
04:42.360 --> 04:43.159
Jiuying?

44
04:46.680 --> 04:47.610
Are you alright?

45
04:49.430 --> 04:50.730
How are you, buddy?

46
04:50.800 --> 04:52.130
Quick, get a physician!

47
04:52.360 --> 04:52.920
Come on.

48
04:52.920 --> 04:53.430
Li Si?

49
04:53.430 --> 04:55.030
Help me carry him over there.

50
05:18.600 --> 05:19.860
Lord Constable Ghost.

51
05:20.800 --> 05:21.600
Li Si.

52
05:24.430 --> 05:25.780
You always said

53
05:26.240 --> 05:27.600
when the Severe-Cold Sword is drawn,

54
05:27.600 --> 05:28.600
someone must die.

55
05:28.600 --> 05:29.430
Yet now

56
05:30.310 --> 05:31.190
I'm standing right in front of you,

57
05:31.190 --> 05:32.360
perfectly well.

58
05:32.600 --> 05:33.430
Since

59
05:33.630 --> 05:34.480
I didn't die

60
05:34.480 --> 05:36.010
by your Severe-Cold Sword,

61
05:36.390 --> 05:37.430
that proves

62
05:38.310 --> 05:39.110
it's not

63
05:39.140 --> 05:40.940
a cold-blooded killing weapon.

64
05:41.920 --> 05:42.830
Am I right?

65
05:47.600 --> 05:49.040
Ever since you appeared,

66
05:51.560 --> 05:53.020
the prophecy of this sword

67
05:54.430 --> 05:56.830
doesn't seem to come true as often anymore.

68
05:57.040 --> 05:57.830
This is

69
05:58.800 --> 05:59.860
the will of heaven,

70
06:00.600 --> 06:02.130
the law of cause and effect—

71
06:02.190 --> 06:03.160
and you and I

72
06:05.000 --> 06:06.000
are no different.

73
06:12.950 --> 06:13.800
Li Si.

74
06:14.120 --> 06:14.920
Qingyang?

75
06:20.950 --> 06:21.800
Meng.

76
06:22.680 --> 06:23.480
Meng Rui?

77
06:26.040 --> 06:27.600
I truly never imagined it.

78
06:28.180 --> 06:29.180
To think

79
06:29.310 --> 06:31.370
I almost took a sword strike from you.

80
06:31.430 --> 06:33.760
Thank goodness Qingyang arrived in time.

81
06:39.920 --> 06:40.720
Sir.

82
06:41.950 --> 06:43.750
Sir, your skill is extraordinary.

83
06:43.750 --> 06:45.409
You've resolved this crisis.

84
06:45.800 --> 06:47.310
May I ask your name?

85
06:52.190 --> 06:53.050
Third Brother,

86
06:53.830 --> 06:55.760
you didn't recognize me after all.

87
06:57.430 --> 06:58.230
This subject,

88
06:58.830 --> 07:00.040
Divine Constable Li Qingyang

89
07:00.040 --> 07:01.840
of the Divine Constable Bureau,

90
07:02.240 --> 07:04.900
pays his respects to Your Highness Prince Ping.

91
07:07.750 --> 07:09.340
So you're

92
07:09.830 --> 07:12.690
Divine Constable Qingyang, famous in the capital.

93
07:13.720 --> 07:14.720
Yes, that's me.

94
07:16.950 --> 07:17.750
Good.

95
07:18.360 --> 07:19.560
Our Great Shi Dynasty

96
07:19.720 --> 07:21.120
truly teems with talent.

97
07:23.430 --> 07:25.310
Constable Ghost Meng Rui of the Divine Constable Bureau

98
07:25.310 --> 07:27.920
-pays his respects to Your Highness. -Greetings, Your Highness.

99
07:27.920 --> 07:28.720
Thanks to

100
07:29.510 --> 07:30.800
your Bureau being here tonight,

101
07:30.800 --> 07:33.120
Liluo's evil plot was thwarted.

102
07:34.159 --> 07:35.120
You've rendered great service in protecting us.

103
07:35.120 --> 07:35.980
Your Highness!

104
07:39.000 --> 07:39.950
Greetings, Your Highness.

105
07:39.950 --> 07:40.920
How is the Grand Heir Apparent?

106
07:40.920 --> 07:41.750
Rest assured, Your Highness.

107
07:41.750 --> 07:43.390
His Highness the Grand Heir Apparent is safe and sound.

108
07:43.390 --> 07:44.800
Take me to Lord Huo immediately.

109
07:44.800 --> 07:45.480
Yes.

110
07:50.750 --> 07:51.610
Your Highness.

111
07:55.630 --> 07:56.430
Li Si.

112
07:58.190 --> 07:59.000
Meng Rui.

113
08:00.040 --> 08:01.190
You're both here.

114
08:02.040 --> 08:02.800
That's great.

115
08:02.800 --> 08:04.260
Look how happy Zhenzhu is.

116
08:05.190 --> 08:06.390
Still,

117
08:06.600 --> 08:08.430
it seems we have tonight's crisis

118
08:08.430 --> 08:09.830
to thank for bringing us,

119
08:09.920 --> 08:12.380
the Four Divine Constables, back together.

120
08:12.430 --> 08:13.190
Qingyang,

121
08:13.830 --> 08:14.800
you have no idea

122
08:15.040 --> 08:16.230
how we've managed to

123
08:16.950 --> 08:18.810
get through the days without you.

124
08:24.240 --> 08:25.090
I know

125
08:25.130 --> 08:26.240
you must all

126
08:27.190 --> 08:28.750
have a lot of questions about me.

127
08:28.750 --> 08:29.560
But

128
08:30.190 --> 08:31.720
the most important thing right now

129
08:31.720 --> 08:33.440
is to solve this case.

130
08:33.909 --> 08:34.909
I'll explain

131
08:35.630 --> 08:37.030
everything later.

132
08:38.030 --> 08:39.159
Divine Constables!

133
08:39.789 --> 08:40.600
Bad news!

134
08:41.549 --> 08:42.480
General Sui Bing

135
08:42.840 --> 08:44.700
was killed by the shadow puppets.

136
08:45.630 --> 08:46.630
What did you say?

137
08:47.320 --> 08:48.630
Where is the body now?

138
08:49.200 --> 08:50.460
In the Langyue Studio.

139
08:51.620 --> 08:55.560
[Langyue Studio]

140
09:03.360 --> 09:04.150
General!

141
09:04.200 --> 09:05.130
Don't touch him!

142
09:14.790 --> 09:16.630
Who was the first to discover the body?

143
09:16.630 --> 09:17.440
I was.

144
09:19.200 --> 09:20.750
When the shadow puppets began their rampage,

145
09:20.750 --> 09:22.320
and there was no sign of the General,

146
09:22.320 --> 09:23.790
I sent someone here to look for him.

147
09:23.790 --> 09:25.050
But I didn't expect...

148
09:25.550 --> 09:27.390
I'd seen the General

149
09:27.390 --> 09:29.550
patrolling the Tongtian Pavilion earlier.

150
09:29.550 --> 09:31.240
Why did he come back to the Langyue Studio?

151
09:31.240 --> 09:32.170
The General said

152
09:33.030 --> 09:34.440
he was coming back to get something.

153
09:34.440 --> 09:35.440
When was that?

154
09:35.600 --> 09:36.960
Not long after the General left,

155
09:36.960 --> 09:38.560
the lunar eclipse occurred.

156
09:38.600 --> 09:39.960
How long is "not long"?

157
09:40.440 --> 09:41.600
About an hour.

158
09:48.510 --> 09:49.320
What did you find?

159
09:49.320 --> 09:49.960
Same as

160
09:49.960 --> 09:51.150
the previous 9 victims.

161
09:51.150 --> 09:53.240
Sui Bing had a penetrating wound on the side of his neck

162
09:53.240 --> 09:54.970
and died of massive blood loss.

163
09:55.200 --> 09:57.000
What about his internal organs?

164
09:59.720 --> 10:00.630
His heart and liver

165
10:00.630 --> 10:01.720
were both gone.

166
10:05.120 --> 10:05.910
Looks like

167
10:06.240 --> 10:08.630
the rumors going around town aren't completely baseless.

168
10:08.630 --> 10:10.390
How exactly did our General die?

169
10:10.390 --> 10:11.030
Could it really be

170
10:11.030 --> 10:12.390
as the townspeople say,

171
10:12.390 --> 10:14.200
that the shadow puppet ghost took his life?

172
10:14.200 --> 10:15.000
I heard

173
10:15.120 --> 10:16.390
that the ghost needs to collect

174
10:16.390 --> 10:17.990
81 sets of hearts and livers.

175
10:18.000 --> 10:20.270
Could this be connected to Liluo's Dark Night?

176
10:20.270 --> 10:21.080
Sui Bing might've been

177
10:21.080 --> 10:22.000
caught in the illusion like us

178
10:22.000 --> 10:23.260
and killed by mistake.

179
10:25.910 --> 10:27.440
The incident in Gutan County

180
10:27.440 --> 10:29.240
is most likely the work of Liluo's Dark Night.

181
10:29.240 --> 10:30.970
However, there seems to be more

182
10:31.750 --> 10:33.150
to Sui Bing's death.

183
10:33.440 --> 10:35.390
We all saw it just now.

184
10:35.550 --> 10:36.960
The illusion technique makes

185
10:36.960 --> 10:38.960
those caught in it kill one another.

186
10:39.630 --> 10:41.120
Yet Sui Bing died

187
10:41.440 --> 10:43.440
in the same manner as the previous 9 victims.

188
10:43.440 --> 10:44.700
How do we explain that?

189
10:45.000 --> 10:46.440
Yan makes a fair point.

190
10:47.240 --> 10:50.120
Sui Bing didn't die from the illusion,

191
10:51.200 --> 10:52.530
yet it doesn't seem to be

192
10:53.240 --> 10:54.550
the work of the killer who murdered

193
10:54.550 --> 10:55.810
the previous 9 either,

194
10:55.910 --> 10:56.720
because

195
10:57.030 --> 10:58.750
the method is different.

196
10:58.910 --> 11:00.170
The previous 9 victims

197
11:00.440 --> 11:01.320
were all

198
11:01.440 --> 11:02.910
hung up

199
11:02.910 --> 11:04.110
like shadow puppets.

200
11:04.790 --> 11:06.550
The killer went to such lengths,

201
11:06.550 --> 11:09.120
so there must be a deeper motive.

202
11:10.910 --> 11:12.570
But why wasn't Sui Bing's body

203
11:12.840 --> 11:14.550
hung up?

204
11:15.390 --> 11:16.960
I agree with Li Si.

205
11:17.030 --> 11:18.320
Although the wound on the side of Sui Bing's neck

206
11:18.320 --> 11:18.970
looks

207
11:18.990 --> 11:20.240
the same as the previous victims',

208
11:20.240 --> 11:22.000
if you look closely, you'll find

209
11:22.000 --> 11:23.630
the edges of the wound are smooth and even,

210
11:23.630 --> 11:24.550
unlike theirs.

211
11:24.750 --> 11:26.260
It looks more like someone pierced his neck with a sharp weapon

212
11:26.260 --> 11:27.720
to mimic that appearance.

213
11:28.550 --> 11:29.950
Another copycat crime.

214
11:30.030 --> 11:31.340
Interesting.

215
11:31.440 --> 11:34.000
The shadow puppet ghost copied Yin Jie's method,

216
11:34.000 --> 11:35.600
and whoever killed Sui Bing

217
11:35.630 --> 11:37.840
copied the ghost's.

218
11:39.150 --> 11:40.910
Are we overthinking this?

219
11:41.030 --> 11:41.940
Liluo

220
11:41.960 --> 11:43.960
broke into the Golden Dragon Pavilion tonight.

221
11:43.960 --> 11:45.890
They're still our prime suspects.

222
11:45.910 --> 11:47.320
If it really was the Dark Night,

223
11:47.320 --> 11:48.240
their target

224
11:48.240 --> 11:50.500
should've been the Grand Heir Apparent.

225
11:52.030 --> 11:52.910
General Ji.

226
11:52.910 --> 11:53.720
Yes.

227
11:53.720 --> 11:55.840
Please have the men of the Xuanjie Battalion

228
11:55.840 --> 11:58.320
search every inch of the Langyue Studio,

229
11:58.320 --> 12:00.200
inside and out, top to bottom.

230
12:00.440 --> 12:01.750
If you find anything

231
12:01.750 --> 12:02.960
unusual,

232
12:03.000 --> 12:04.400
let us know immediately.

233
12:04.440 --> 12:05.200
Okay,

234
12:05.360 --> 12:06.360
I'll see to it now.

235
12:07.390 --> 12:10.450
You think there's something wrong with this building?

236
12:15.200 --> 12:17.000
"The dragon lies hidden in the deep;

237
12:17.000 --> 12:18.730
its depths are unfathomable."

238
12:19.440 --> 12:20.190
I suspect

239
12:20.220 --> 12:22.840
there's more to this vast Golden Dragon Pavilion

240
12:22.840 --> 12:24.150
than meets the eye.

241
12:26.200 --> 12:27.150
Anyway,

242
12:27.790 --> 12:29.440
you and Meng Rui are back with us.

243
12:29.440 --> 12:30.320
Everything

244
12:30.320 --> 12:31.550
will be easier to handle.

245
12:31.550 --> 12:32.480
Right, Zhenzhu?

246
12:34.150 --> 12:35.880
Let's go downstairs and check.

247
12:46.630 --> 12:47.980
Osmanthus wine.

248
12:48.030 --> 12:49.120
I know this.

249
12:49.510 --> 12:51.200
Lots of taverns in town sell it.

250
12:50.540 --> 12:52.000
[Osmanthus Wine]

251
12:51.360 --> 12:52.160
A tavern owner

252
12:52.320 --> 12:54.030
once spent ages telling me all about it.

253
12:54.030 --> 12:55.190
So this must be

254
12:55.210 --> 12:57.000
the renowned aged brew of Gutan County.

255
12:57.000 --> 12:58.200
The osmanthus wine

256
12:58.200 --> 12:59.390
does taste quite good.

257
12:59.390 --> 13:00.240
And it's

258
13:00.240 --> 13:01.550
only authentic

259
13:01.550 --> 13:02.790
when sold in a crystal-clear jug

260
13:02.790 --> 13:03.840
like this.

261
13:04.390 --> 13:05.360
I smelled this same scent

262
13:05.360 --> 13:06.440
upstairs just now.

263
13:11.240 --> 13:12.200
I get it.

264
13:13.150 --> 13:15.150
After the killer murdered Sui Bing,

265
13:15.200 --> 13:16.200
he saw

266
13:16.390 --> 13:18.030
a bottle of osmanthus wine on the table,

267
13:18.030 --> 13:19.630
and the craving got the better of him.

268
13:19.630 --> 13:21.320
He couldn't resist the temptation,

269
13:21.320 --> 13:22.320
so he took the wine

270
13:22.320 --> 13:23.790
with him as he fled.

271
13:24.000 --> 13:25.790
But he was so nervous

272
13:26.150 --> 13:27.390
that as soon as he got downstairs,

273
13:27.390 --> 13:29.200
he accidentally dropped it and smashed it here.

274
13:29.200 --> 13:29.910
Well...

275
13:31.440 --> 13:32.630
Two bottles?

276
13:33.840 --> 13:36.030
Then the killer took 2 bottles of osmanthus wine.

277
13:36.030 --> 13:37.290
The pavilion has rules

278
13:37.440 --> 13:38.570
against eating meat

279
13:38.600 --> 13:39.660
and drinking wine.

280
13:39.960 --> 13:40.750
Sui Bing even

281
13:41.150 --> 13:42.840
made a huge scene at the Department of Food Affairs

282
13:42.840 --> 13:43.840
over it.

283
13:44.370 --> 13:45.200
I also took note

284
13:45.050 --> 13:47.070
[Langyue Studio]

285
13:45.630 --> 13:47.390
when Sui Bing moved into

286
13:47.600 --> 13:49.240
the Langyue Studio that night.

287
13:49.240 --> 13:50.390
There was no wine

288
13:50.960 --> 13:51.910
with his meal.

289
13:53.630 --> 13:55.440
Sui Bing was clearly

290
13:55.790 --> 13:57.450
wary of the pavilion's rules.

291
13:58.000 --> 13:59.070
If these 2 bottles of wine

292
13:59.070 --> 14:00.670
really belonged to Sui Bing,

293
14:00.790 --> 14:02.350
and he was a heavy drinker,

294
14:02.630 --> 14:04.960
why didn't he open and drink them right away?

295
14:04.960 --> 14:06.740
Yet the stoppers are still

296
14:07.000 --> 14:10.000
firmly in place, even now.

297
14:14.200 --> 14:15.000
Therefore,

298
14:16.840 --> 14:18.320
these 2 bottles

299
14:18.510 --> 14:19.630
were meant to

300
14:19.630 --> 14:21.440
be given to him by someone else.

301
14:21.210 --> 14:29.460
[Langyue Studio]

302
14:21.720 --> 14:23.550
Tonight, the entire Xuanjie Battalion

303
14:23.550 --> 14:25.810
was sent to guard the Tongtian Pavilion,

304
14:25.960 --> 14:27.840
so no one was posted

305
14:27.840 --> 14:29.320
at the Langyue Studio.

306
14:29.600 --> 14:32.720
It was the perfect chance to sneak in and deliver the wine.

307
14:32.720 --> 14:34.120
But right at that moment,

308
14:34.200 --> 14:36.450
a lunar eclipse occurred.

309
14:36.550 --> 14:38.440
Liluo seized the opportunity to wreak havoc,

310
14:38.440 --> 14:40.840
and the shadow puppets suddenly appeared.

311
14:41.000 --> 14:42.630
What that person didn't expect

312
14:42.630 --> 14:44.630
was that Sui Bing had already been murdered by then.

313
14:44.630 --> 14:46.630
So, in his panic,

314
14:46.630 --> 14:47.790
he fled,

315
14:47.790 --> 14:49.240
leaving the wine behind.

316
14:50.390 --> 14:52.320
According to your theory,

317
14:52.910 --> 14:53.810
before we arrived

318
14:53.810 --> 14:55.120
at the crime scene,

319
14:55.200 --> 14:57.000
there should've been a 3rd person there

320
14:57.000 --> 14:59.200
besides Sui Bing and the killer.

321
14:59.200 --> 15:00.790
If we find the 3rd person,

322
15:01.200 --> 15:02.750
we may be able to determine

323
15:03.320 --> 15:05.200
Sui Bing's exact time of death.

324
15:05.360 --> 15:07.240
Sui Bing was transferred here on short notice.

325
15:07.240 --> 15:08.440
He was new to the area.

326
15:08.630 --> 15:10.120
Someone who knew he loved wine

327
15:10.120 --> 15:10.910
and was willing to risk

328
15:10.910 --> 15:12.640
breaking the pavilion's rules

329
15:13.000 --> 15:14.720
to sneak him some...

330
15:14.840 --> 15:16.960
Someone with that kind of friendship with him here...

331
15:16.960 --> 15:18.120
The magistrate of Gutan County,

332
15:18.120 --> 15:19.600
-Du Zhongtao. -Mr. Sui!

333
15:24.200 --> 15:25.000
Yan,

334
15:25.200 --> 15:26.440
Meng Rui, Zhenzhu,

335
15:26.840 --> 15:28.000
I'll leave Du Zhongtao

336
15:28.000 --> 15:29.000
to you.

337
15:29.440 --> 15:31.000
I want to go back to the Department of Food Affairs

338
15:31.000 --> 15:32.000
to see if I can

339
15:32.000 --> 15:33.440
find any new clues.

340
15:33.750 --> 15:35.120
My Lord, I'm innocent.

341
15:35.120 --> 15:36.630
I'm innocent, My Lord!

342
15:38.200 --> 15:39.600
How are things out there?

343
15:40.200 --> 15:41.360
Minister,

344
15:41.510 --> 15:42.390
the search is complete.

345
15:42.390 --> 15:43.000
All of the Dark Night's forces

346
15:43.000 --> 15:44.790
have been driven out of the pavilion.

347
15:44.790 --> 15:45.750
The Yulin Army is also

348
15:45.750 --> 15:48.680
pursuing the fleeing remnants with all their might.

349
15:49.150 --> 15:50.680
Liluo has stirred up chaos,

350
15:50.720 --> 15:52.150
and Sui Bing has been murdered.

351
15:52.150 --> 15:54.210
His Highness Prince Ping is furious!

352
15:54.510 --> 15:55.440
I've already urgently requested

353
15:55.440 --> 15:57.000
the Yulin Army to enter the pavilion.

354
15:57.000 --> 15:58.790
I said long ago that

355
15:59.000 --> 16:00.630
this whole business about shadow puppets killing people

356
16:00.630 --> 16:01.810
was clearly a cover for someone

357
16:01.810 --> 16:02.750
plotting evil!

358
16:03.200 --> 16:03.870
Liluo

359
16:03.870 --> 16:06.320
has never given up their desire to destroy our country.

360
16:06.320 --> 16:07.200
And now,

361
16:07.200 --> 16:09.320
they've openly targeted the Grand Heir Apparent.

362
16:09.320 --> 16:10.720
It's utterly heinous!

363
16:11.030 --> 16:11.840
Du Zhongtao!

364
16:12.750 --> 16:13.550
My Lord.

365
16:13.790 --> 16:15.790
How exactly did Sui Bing die?

366
16:16.200 --> 16:17.400
Confess truthfully!

367
16:17.550 --> 16:18.360
My Lord,

368
16:18.600 --> 16:19.750
I really don't know.

369
16:19.750 --> 16:21.120
I'm innocent.

370
16:21.390 --> 16:23.060
I... I only knew...

371
16:23.150 --> 16:24.270
knew that Sui Bing loved wine,

372
16:24.270 --> 16:25.390
so... so I thought I'd

373
16:25.390 --> 16:26.510
secretly bring him some

374
16:26.510 --> 16:27.780
to... to drink with him.

375
16:27.780 --> 16:28.440
But I never imagined...

376
16:28.440 --> 16:29.390
I never imagined I'd run into

377
16:29.390 --> 16:30.770
the shadow puppet ghost causing trouble.

378
16:30.770 --> 16:32.000
By... By the time I went up to

379
16:32.000 --> 16:33.000
the top floor of the Langyue Studio,

380
16:33.000 --> 16:33.600
General Sui...

381
16:33.600 --> 16:35.030
General Sui was already dead.

382
16:35.030 --> 16:36.240
Sui Bing, this is bad!

383
16:36.240 --> 16:37.030
The vengeful shadow puppet ghost...

384
16:37.030 --> 16:37.840
The vengeful shadow puppet ghost...

385
16:37.840 --> 16:39.030
Sui Bing, Sui...

386
16:47.750 --> 16:48.550
My Lord.

387
16:49.630 --> 16:50.720
It must've been the shadow puppet ghost

388
16:50.720 --> 16:51.650
that killed him.

389
16:52.080 --> 16:52.840
Sui Bing's heart and liver

390
16:52.840 --> 16:54.200
must've been dug out too,

391
16:54.200 --> 16:55.000
right?

392
16:59.550 --> 17:00.360
Right?

393
17:03.550 --> 17:04.720
Didn't I say so?

394
17:05.160 --> 17:06.400
Didn't I say so?

395
17:06.440 --> 17:07.829
It was Yin Jie's vengeful spirit

396
17:07.829 --> 17:08.690
who killed him.

397
17:09.160 --> 17:09.960
It wasn't me.

398
17:10.109 --> 17:11.710
It really wasn't me, My Lord!

399
17:12.200 --> 17:13.640
Since you found the body,

400
17:13.640 --> 17:15.440
why didn't you report it immediately?

401
17:15.440 --> 17:17.920
I was scared out of my wits at the time.

402
17:17.920 --> 17:18.440
I just figured

403
17:18.440 --> 17:20.569
I wasn't the one who killed him anyway.

404
17:20.790 --> 17:21.839
A-And now that

405
17:21.869 --> 17:22.880
the Divine Constables are here,

406
17:22.880 --> 17:25.280
they will definitely find the real killer.

407
17:25.640 --> 17:28.000
Better to avoid trouble when you can, right?

408
17:28.000 --> 17:29.510
As the magistrate of Gutan County,

409
17:29.510 --> 17:30.750
you're so cowardly!

410
17:30.750 --> 17:31.790
My Lord, please spare me.

411
17:31.790 --> 17:32.960
Please spare me, My Lord.

412
17:32.960 --> 17:33.750
My Lord...

413
17:35.000 --> 17:37.000
Once the blessing ceremony is over,

414
17:37.310 --> 17:39.160
I'll make you answer for this.

415
17:39.750 --> 17:40.240
Get out!

416
17:52.790 --> 17:53.830
Minister.

417
17:56.440 --> 17:57.240
I'm fine.

418
18:00.310 --> 18:01.440
Regarding the chaos

419
18:01.550 --> 18:03.440
caused by the Liluo remnants tonight,

420
18:03.440 --> 18:05.920
the Grand Heir Apparent has made his position clear.

421
18:05.920 --> 18:08.160
He wants us never to be cowed by such acts of violence

422
18:08.160 --> 18:10.090
and to eradicate evil completely.

423
18:10.160 --> 18:10.960
Also,

424
18:11.550 --> 18:14.200
the rite of beseeching heaven and the blessing ceremony

425
18:14.200 --> 18:15.830
must proceed as planned.

426
18:16.750 --> 18:18.350
Ji Xun of the Xuanjie Battalion,

427
18:18.350 --> 18:20.280
you'll serve as acting commander.

428
18:20.640 --> 18:22.170
I, Ji Xun, accept the order.

429
18:30.720 --> 18:31.920
What Du Zhongtao said

430
18:31.960 --> 18:33.000
proves that Li Si's deduction

431
18:33.000 --> 18:33.920
is correct.

432
18:34.030 --> 18:34.960
That means

433
18:35.200 --> 18:37.000
Sui Bing actually died

434
18:37.070 --> 18:37.840
when Liluo

435
18:37.870 --> 18:39.000
started manipulating the shadow puppets

436
18:39.000 --> 18:40.200
to cause chaos,

437
18:40.200 --> 18:41.640
or even earlier.

438
18:41.750 --> 18:42.590
If the killer really was

439
18:42.590 --> 18:43.640
Liluo's Dark Night,

440
18:43.640 --> 18:45.400
that would explain the motive.

441
18:45.510 --> 18:47.000
Even if they couldn't kill the Grand Heir Apparent,

442
18:47.000 --> 18:47.920
killing the general

443
18:47.920 --> 18:48.960
responsible for his protection

444
18:48.960 --> 18:50.690
would remove a major obstacle.

445
18:50.830 --> 18:51.830
Exactly.

446
18:51.830 --> 18:53.550
But there is one thing that doesn't add up.

447
18:53.550 --> 18:54.510
Once they killed him,

448
18:54.510 --> 18:55.590
their objective was achieved.

449
18:55.590 --> 18:57.160
Why still cut out his heart and liver?

450
18:57.160 --> 18:58.760
Didn't we just analyze that?

451
18:58.920 --> 19:00.000
To imitate the earlier killings

452
19:00.000 --> 19:01.720
and blame it on the shadow puppet ghost.

453
19:01.720 --> 19:03.000
That's exactly the bizarre part of

454
19:03.000 --> 19:04.000
Sui Bing's death.

455
19:04.200 --> 19:05.720
As they say, if you're going to put on a show, do it right.

456
19:05.720 --> 19:07.000
If it was a copycat crime,

457
19:07.000 --> 19:08.720
why did they have time to take out his heart and liver

458
19:08.720 --> 19:09.530
but not enough time

459
19:09.530 --> 19:11.000
to hang up the body?

460
19:11.000 --> 19:12.160
I think so too.

461
19:13.750 --> 19:15.480
Let's wait and see

462
19:15.480 --> 19:16.790
what Li Si can find out.

463
19:16.790 --> 19:18.240
I want to go back to the Langyue Studio

464
19:18.240 --> 19:19.180
and take Sui Bing's body

465
19:19.180 --> 19:20.170
to the county office

466
19:20.170 --> 19:21.770
for a thorough examination.

467
19:21.830 --> 19:23.110
It's closer if we cut through

468
19:23.110 --> 19:24.030
Tinghe Pond.

469
19:24.240 --> 19:24.920
Let's go.

470
19:24.920 --> 19:25.590
Let's go.

471
19:28.870 --> 19:31.910
[Department of Food Affairs]

472
19:30.750 --> 19:32.110
Nothing like last night

473
19:32.240 --> 19:33.750
has happened since the Golden Dragon Pavilion

474
19:33.750 --> 19:35.310
was built!

475
19:35.590 --> 19:36.510
Were there assassins?

476
19:36.510 --> 19:37.830
Not assassins.

477
19:37.830 --> 19:39.200
It was the vengeful shadow puppet ghost

478
19:39.200 --> 19:41.550
coming to the Golden Dragon Pavilion for revenge!

479
19:41.550 --> 19:42.510
That eerie?

480
19:42.510 --> 19:43.520
I heard

481
19:43.590 --> 19:45.160
that Yin Jie

482
19:45.440 --> 19:48.000
was eaten by the Dragon King himself.

483
19:50.030 --> 19:50.830
Xiaoshan,

484
19:51.310 --> 19:52.790
did you really see it?

485
19:52.790 --> 19:54.400
"See it"?

486
19:54.400 --> 19:56.240
It flew right over my head!

487
19:57.240 --> 19:59.440
Blood was raining down from the sky.

488
19:59.790 --> 20:01.000
Luckily, I reacted fast

489
20:01.000 --> 20:02.110
and hid behind a rock.

490
20:02.110 --> 20:03.400
Otherwise, I would've been caught

491
20:03.400 --> 20:05.460
and had my heart and liver ripped out!

492
20:05.510 --> 20:07.440
It seems the duties at the Golden Dragon Pavilion

493
20:07.440 --> 20:09.310
are too easy for you lot.

494
20:09.440 --> 20:10.970
Be careful,

495
20:10.990 --> 20:12.750
or I'll have Lord Huo pull out your tongues!

496
20:12.750 --> 20:13.440
Just now,

497
20:13.440 --> 20:15.160
this foolish servant has spoken out of turn again.

498
20:15.160 --> 20:16.690
Please forgive me, Eunuch.

499
20:19.720 --> 20:20.960
Keep your mouths shut

500
20:21.590 --> 20:23.160
about what happened

501
20:23.400 --> 20:24.590
last night.

502
20:25.000 --> 20:27.240
Whoever dares to leak a single word

503
20:27.350 --> 20:28.760
will be beheaded!

504
20:30.000 --> 20:30.830
-Yes. -Yes.

505
20:35.510 --> 20:38.720
This is what the Grand Heir Apparent left over from last night.

506
20:38.720 --> 20:39.960
Hurry up and take it.

507
20:42.590 --> 20:44.000
Get back to work, all of you.

508
20:44.000 --> 20:44.510
Let's go.

509
20:44.510 --> 20:45.750
Let's go.

510
20:46.110 --> 20:46.920
Let me.

511
21:31.620 --> 21:36.880
[Upright and Impartial]

512
21:31.790 --> 21:32.310
He's coming?

513
21:32.310 --> 21:33.040
He's coming!

514
22:25.240 --> 22:27.310
We can finally work on cases

515
22:29.350 --> 22:30.280
together again.

516
22:41.270 --> 22:42.070
Yan.

517
22:52.110 --> 22:53.440
Mr. Yan, are you okay?

518
22:53.440 --> 22:54.310
What?

519
22:54.440 --> 22:56.790
I... D-Don't follow me.

520
22:58.110 --> 22:58.920
I must say,

521
22:59.880 --> 23:01.010
Sanhuo is indeed

522
23:01.040 --> 23:02.310
the happiest one...

523
23:04.310 --> 23:06.110
in our Divine Constable Bureau.

524
23:06.720 --> 23:07.510
I...

525
23:25.750 --> 23:27.680
Looks like Zhenzhu guessed right.

526
23:27.680 --> 23:29.640
It really was the Chief who saved you.

527
23:29.640 --> 23:31.240
And you kept us in the dark,

528
23:31.440 --> 23:32.550
making us worry.

529
23:32.590 --> 23:33.400
I didn't mean

530
23:33.400 --> 23:34.460
to keep it from you.

531
23:34.720 --> 23:35.620
It's just that

532
23:36.350 --> 23:37.350
Li San and I

533
23:37.750 --> 23:39.350
were master and disciple,

534
23:39.440 --> 23:40.680
and he was from Liluo.

535
23:40.770 --> 23:41.640
I was worried

536
23:42.030 --> 23:43.030
his identity

537
23:43.350 --> 23:44.750
might put you all at risk.

538
23:45.070 --> 23:45.880
Li Si,

539
23:46.070 --> 23:47.870
what exactly is your connection

540
23:48.030 --> 23:49.400
to Li San and Liluo?

541
23:51.640 --> 23:52.510
Li San saved me

542
23:53.030 --> 23:54.200
when I was a child.

543
23:55.680 --> 23:57.000
He also taught me

544
23:57.350 --> 23:58.720
everything I know.

545
23:59.440 --> 24:00.790
To me,

546
24:01.240 --> 24:02.790
he was like a second father.

547
24:03.270 --> 24:04.440
That's all.

548
24:05.640 --> 24:06.440
However,

549
24:07.440 --> 24:08.670
I, Li Si, have never done

550
24:08.670 --> 24:10.160
anything atrocious,

551
24:10.200 --> 24:11.730
nor have I aided evildoers.

552
24:12.270 --> 24:13.400
Liluo and I

553
24:14.030 --> 24:15.350
are enemies, not friends.

554
24:15.350 --> 24:16.160
See?

555
24:16.230 --> 24:17.400
I told you so.

556
24:20.640 --> 24:21.440
Zhenzhu,

557
24:21.790 --> 24:22.640
how is it?

558
24:23.160 --> 24:24.460
Do you know what exactly is

559
24:24.460 --> 24:25.460
on this?

560
24:26.000 --> 24:27.200
It should be

561
24:27.590 --> 24:29.320
scales from an insect's wings.

562
24:29.790 --> 24:30.590
Chiying bugs?

563
24:30.960 --> 24:31.750
No.

564
24:32.470 --> 24:33.330
It's a bug

565
24:33.360 --> 24:34.840
with beautiful wings.

566
24:35.960 --> 24:36.750
A butterfly?

567
24:40.000 --> 24:41.860
That actually could be it.

568
24:42.830 --> 24:45.440
Butterflies are attracted to sweet things.

569
24:45.750 --> 24:47.750
And the Grand Heir Apparent's meals

570
24:47.790 --> 24:49.030
include many desserts,

571
24:49.030 --> 24:50.400
like sweet milk curd.

572
24:50.590 --> 24:51.640
Perhaps

573
24:52.000 --> 24:53.640
they were drawn by the scent

574
24:53.640 --> 24:54.790
on the chopsticks.

575
24:55.000 --> 24:56.550
But where would we find butterflies

576
24:56.550 --> 24:57.680
at this time of year?

577
24:58.160 --> 24:59.160
Where indeed...

578
25:03.440 --> 25:04.830
The gods grant blessings,

579
25:04.800 --> 25:06.080
[Golden Dragon Pavilion]

580
25:05.000 --> 25:06.610
and the golden dragon brings good fortune,

581
25:06.610 --> 25:08.210
as we beseech heaven!

582
25:22.590 --> 25:25.000
On the 13th day of the 11th month,

583
25:25.000 --> 25:27.550
in the 37th year of Hongyun,

584
25:27.750 --> 25:29.400
Zhou Ye, the Grand Heir Apparent,

585
25:29.400 --> 25:32.070
solemnly presents this memorial to the heavens.

586
25:32.070 --> 25:34.350
At the winter solstice,

587
25:34.350 --> 25:35.750
the 6 vital energies renew.

588
25:35.750 --> 25:37.240
In solemn observance of the ancient rites,

589
25:37.240 --> 25:38.880
I respectfully lead my officials

590
25:38.880 --> 25:42.590
in presenting jade, silk, livestock, grain, and other offerings,

591
25:42.590 --> 25:44.000
preparing incense and sacrificial fires

592
25:44.000 --> 25:46.110
to worship the heavens.

593
25:46.880 --> 25:48.240
For such an important ceremony

594
25:48.240 --> 25:50.130
as the rite of beseeching heaven,

595
25:50.240 --> 25:51.440
why has Abbot Yun Hai

596
25:51.440 --> 25:52.590
still not appeared?

597
25:53.750 --> 25:56.240
The Abbot has been in seclusion for 20 years.

598
25:56.680 --> 25:58.280
If he doesn't wish to emerge,

599
25:58.640 --> 26:00.640
there is little we can do.

600
26:12.030 --> 26:14.850
Set the dragon lanterns aloft!

601
26:47.830 --> 26:48.750
Look! Look!

602
26:48.830 --> 26:49.790
There are dragons!

603
26:49.790 --> 26:50.860
Where? Where?

604
26:51.890 --> 26:56.180
[Upright and Impartial]

605
26:52.750 --> 26:53.480
There really are!

606
26:53.480 --> 26:54.070
Yeah.

607
26:54.070 --> 26:56.200
-There really are dragons. -Dragons.

608
26:56.400 --> 26:57.400
They look so lifelike!

609
26:57.400 --> 26:58.260
Flying so high.

610
27:01.640 --> 27:03.900
The rite of beseeching heaven has begun.

611
27:05.480 --> 27:07.400
Now that the ceremony has started,

612
27:07.400 --> 27:08.480
no one may wander freely

613
27:08.480 --> 27:10.240
within the Golden Dragon Pavilion.

614
27:10.240 --> 27:11.270
It will be even harder

615
27:11.270 --> 27:12.400
to investigate now.

616
27:13.750 --> 27:15.000
The golden dragons bring good fortune.

617
27:15.000 --> 27:16.000
They look so real.

618
27:16.550 --> 27:18.000
Look at you, so easily impressed.

619
27:18.000 --> 27:20.330
Shows how little you've seen of the world!

620
27:21.440 --> 27:22.830
If we can't investigate inside,

621
27:22.830 --> 27:24.430
we'll investigate outside.

622
27:25.550 --> 27:26.350
Zhao Quan.

623
27:28.880 --> 27:29.750
Sir,

624
27:30.240 --> 27:31.310
you know me?

625
27:31.350 --> 27:32.590
Not only do I know you,

626
27:32.680 --> 27:34.480
but I also know your magistrate.

627
27:35.240 --> 27:36.030
Yes, yes.

628
27:36.350 --> 27:37.790
A friend of the Divine Constables

629
27:37.790 --> 27:38.480
is naturally a friend

630
27:38.480 --> 27:39.550
of our magistrate.

631
27:39.750 --> 27:40.920
Where is your magistrate?

632
27:40.920 --> 27:41.810
Ever since the magistrate returned

633
27:41.810 --> 27:42.880
from the Golden Dragon Pavilion last night,

634
27:42.880 --> 27:44.400
he hasn't been feeling well.

635
27:44.400 --> 27:46.460
He's resting in a side room right now.

636
27:48.000 --> 27:49.750
Where is Mad Cripple, the man

637
27:49.750 --> 27:51.000
you took away yesterday when we were

638
27:51.000 --> 27:52.680
preparing for the blessing ceremony?

639
27:52.680 --> 27:53.940
He's still being held.

640
27:54.000 --> 27:55.240
Bring him here for questioning.

641
27:55.240 --> 27:55.920
Yes.

642
27:55.960 --> 27:56.750
Daquan, Erxiong,

643
27:56.750 --> 27:57.440
come with me!

644
27:57.440 --> 27:58.110
Hurry!

645
27:58.160 --> 27:58.960
Okay.

646
28:05.550 --> 28:06.550
What's your name?

647
28:08.400 --> 28:09.530
He's mad and raving.

648
28:09.530 --> 28:11.160
He's probably long forgotten who he is.

649
28:11.160 --> 28:13.090
We all just call him "Mad Cripple."

650
28:13.830 --> 28:15.440
What are those in your hand?

651
28:16.030 --> 28:17.400
May I have a look?

652
28:19.070 --> 28:21.000
G-Give them to me.

653
28:22.270 --> 28:23.670
Just 2 worthless stones.

654
28:23.750 --> 28:24.830
When he was brought in,

655
28:24.830 --> 28:26.240
he wouldn't let go of them no matter what.

656
28:26.240 --> 28:27.840
So we had to let him keep them.

657
28:28.270 --> 28:29.600
Covered with calluses.

658
28:32.550 --> 28:34.000
The calluses on your hands

659
28:34.000 --> 28:35.830
come from operating shadow puppets,

660
28:35.830 --> 28:36.680
and your habit of

661
28:36.680 --> 28:38.210
rolling stones in your palm

662
28:38.240 --> 28:40.110
is for building up your hand strength.

663
28:40.110 --> 28:40.920
So,

664
28:41.880 --> 28:43.960
you're a shadow puppeteer.

665
28:45.830 --> 28:48.000
Twice you appeared on Panlong Street,

666
28:48.240 --> 28:50.830
and each time you spoke of the shadow puppet ghost.

667
28:50.830 --> 28:52.890
It's because you harbor resentment.

668
28:53.400 --> 28:54.240
So,

669
28:54.400 --> 28:57.660
you curse everyone, believing they're wicked to the core.

670
28:58.000 --> 28:59.270
You think everyone in the world

671
28:59.270 --> 29:00.640
has wronged you,

672
29:00.960 --> 29:03.200
and you want to rip out their hearts and livers

673
29:03.200 --> 29:05.550
to avenge your dead wife and child.

674
29:06.780 --> 29:08.060
Am I right?

675
29:12.400 --> 29:13.200
Yin Jie.

676
29:21.400 --> 29:22.790
You killed 9 people

677
29:23.000 --> 29:24.510
out of resentment.

678
29:24.830 --> 29:26.490
How can your conscience rest?

679
29:26.550 --> 29:27.640
He is Yin Jie?

680
29:28.350 --> 29:29.910
Didn't Yin Jie die a long time ago?

681
29:29.910 --> 29:31.030
I-I'm not Yin Jie.

682
29:31.030 --> 29:32.230
I didn't kill anyone.

683
29:32.590 --> 29:33.920
They killed them!

684
29:34.270 --> 29:35.400
They killed them!

685
29:35.550 --> 29:36.790
They killed them!

686
29:49.830 --> 29:51.630
Please, take a close look, sirs.

687
29:51.680 --> 29:53.140
Do you recognize this man?

688
29:56.350 --> 29:57.500
Well...

689
30:00.640 --> 30:01.510
Isn't he

690
30:01.640 --> 30:03.720
Gensheng, the boy who lived on everyone's charity?

691
30:03.720 --> 30:04.440
Yes, yes, yes.

692
30:04.440 --> 30:06.080
He is Gensheng.

693
30:06.550 --> 30:07.440
My Lords,

694
30:07.860 --> 30:09.640
this man is from our Yin Village.

695
30:09.640 --> 30:10.840
His name is Gensheng.

696
30:10.880 --> 30:12.230
He was orphaned at a young age,

697
30:12.230 --> 30:14.230
and the villagers helped raise him.

698
30:14.440 --> 30:16.160
Later, he became an apprentice

699
30:16.160 --> 30:18.210
and learned, uh, shadow puppetry.

700
30:18.640 --> 30:19.920
Who was his master?

701
30:20.680 --> 30:23.200
The very one, Yin Jie, the shadow puppet ghost.

702
30:23.200 --> 30:25.030
Ever since that incident,

703
30:25.640 --> 30:27.590
Gensheng has been missing too.

704
30:28.960 --> 30:30.560
Looks like we need to find out

705
30:30.750 --> 30:32.640
what really happened 6 years ago.

706
30:34.160 --> 30:35.400
Where are the remains of Yin Jie's family

707
30:35.400 --> 30:37.000
buried now?

708
30:37.070 --> 30:38.550
Since they were from Yin Village,

709
30:38.550 --> 30:39.470
they would naturally be buried

710
30:39.470 --> 30:40.930
in the village graveyard.

711
30:41.270 --> 30:42.400
But back then,

712
30:42.590 --> 30:44.030
the owner of Xiangrui

713
30:44.200 --> 30:45.920
brought back only the body of Yin Jie's wife,

714
30:45.920 --> 30:47.030
Qin.

715
30:47.440 --> 30:49.070
As for the body of his 3-year-old son,

716
30:49.070 --> 30:49.750
well,

717
30:49.750 --> 30:51.590
we have no idea where it went.

718
30:51.750 --> 30:53.410
Xiangrui Shadow Puppet Shop?

719
30:53.590 --> 30:54.400
That's right.

720
30:57.050 --> 30:58.540
[Xiangrui Shadow Puppet Shop]

721
30:57.790 --> 30:58.640
Shopkeeper Huang,

722
30:58.640 --> 31:00.040
do you still remember me?

723
31:02.400 --> 31:03.630
It's you.

724
31:04.030 --> 31:05.110
I remember.

725
31:09.030 --> 31:11.160
Yin Jie and I were old friends, in a way.

726
31:11.160 --> 31:13.200
He was a solitary man

727
31:13.200 --> 31:14.640
and rarely associated with others.

728
31:14.640 --> 31:15.720
Come to think of it,

729
31:16.000 --> 31:17.550
if he were still alive,

730
31:17.680 --> 31:19.360
we would've known each other

731
31:19.390 --> 31:20.320
for almost

732
31:20.340 --> 31:21.650
15 years by now.

733
31:24.000 --> 31:26.310
Besides his wife and son,

734
31:26.640 --> 31:28.550
did Yin Jie have anyone else in his family?

735
31:28.550 --> 31:31.200
An apprentice, perhaps?

736
31:31.310 --> 31:32.240
He actually did.

737
31:32.240 --> 31:34.400
But that boy was an orphan.

738
31:34.830 --> 31:36.440
Yin Jie never took apprentices,

739
31:36.440 --> 31:37.830
but perhaps out of pity,

740
31:38.240 --> 31:40.030
he took the boy in.

741
31:40.680 --> 31:41.430
And the boy

742
31:41.460 --> 31:42.920
was indeed very talented.

743
31:44.400 --> 31:45.750
In just a couple of years,

744
31:45.750 --> 31:48.610
the shadow puppets he made were quite respectable.

745
31:49.030 --> 31:50.420
Master, when will you

746
31:50.440 --> 31:52.570
teach me "The Magpie Bridge Reunion"?

747
31:53.640 --> 31:54.580
When

748
31:54.680 --> 31:56.010
you draw this old man

749
31:56.040 --> 31:57.610
nicely,

750
31:57.640 --> 31:59.200
I'll teach you.

751
31:59.880 --> 32:01.110
You little brat.

752
32:05.680 --> 32:06.880
The show is starting!

753
32:09.830 --> 32:11.640
Yin Jie's best play

754
32:11.640 --> 32:13.500
was "The Magpie Bridge Reunion."

755
32:13.640 --> 32:15.400
When he and his wife performed it together,

756
32:15.400 --> 32:18.030
the audience would applaud in awe.

757
32:26.960 --> 32:28.750
Yet, for all this time,

758
32:29.640 --> 32:31.970
he hadn't taught Gensheng that very play.

759
32:32.030 --> 32:33.340
Because of this,

760
32:33.750 --> 32:35.960
their relationship as master and apprentice

761
32:35.960 --> 32:37.420
gradually deteriorated.

762
33:01.030 --> 33:02.090
Shopkeeper Huang,

763
33:02.350 --> 33:04.480
I wonder if we could invite your troupe

764
33:05.030 --> 33:07.030
to make a trip to Yin Village with us.

765
33:18.640 --> 33:19.660
Gensheng.

766
33:21.160 --> 33:22.090
Gensheng?

767
33:23.750 --> 33:24.550
Gensheng.

768
33:25.590 --> 33:26.790
You're back.

769
33:27.880 --> 33:30.410
You haven't been back to visit for a long time.

770
33:31.680 --> 33:32.700
Gensheng?

771
33:34.000 --> 33:35.050
Gensheng!

772
33:42.030 --> 33:42.830
Gensheng.

773
33:44.400 --> 33:45.200
Gensheng!

774
33:53.480 --> 33:54.750
Gensheng.

775
33:56.640 --> 33:57.830
Gensheng.

776
33:59.790 --> 34:01.240
Gensheng!

777
34:27.400 --> 34:30.480
♪ Far, far away shines the Cowherd Star ♪

778
34:30.800 --> 34:33.920
♪ Bright is the Weaver Maid ♪

779
34:34.440 --> 34:37.480
♪ Slender and delicate were her hands ♪

780
34:37.710 --> 34:41.420
♪ Click-clack went her loom ♪

781
34:41.480 --> 34:44.880
♪ All day she wove, yet no pattern took shape ♪

782
34:44.920 --> 34:48.260
♪ Tears streamed down her cheeks ♪

783
34:48.510 --> 34:51.920
♪ The Milky Way stretched clear and shallow ♪

784
34:52.020 --> 34:57.150
♪ How far apart could the two shores be? ♪

785
35:03.550 --> 35:04.360
Gensheng,

786
35:04.360 --> 35:05.400
why do you draw the fairy maiden

787
35:05.400 --> 35:06.590
with such intricate lines

788
35:06.590 --> 35:07.760
but the old man

789
35:07.790 --> 35:08.890
with just a few strokes?

790
35:08.890 --> 35:10.800
The fairy maiden will be played by Mrs. Yin,

791
35:10.800 --> 35:12.760
so of course she must be drawn beautifully.

792
35:12.760 --> 35:14.110
As for you, Master,

793
35:14.400 --> 35:15.840
you're an old man both onstage and off.

794
35:15.840 --> 35:17.100
A rough sketch will do.

795
35:18.070 --> 35:18.800
Yu'er,

796
35:18.800 --> 35:19.960
back me up here.

797
35:20.230 --> 35:21.480
It's fitting that he compares you

798
35:21.480 --> 35:22.710
to a fairy maiden.

799
35:23.070 --> 35:25.030
But why do I have to be the old man?

800
35:25.030 --> 35:26.400
You brat.

801
35:30.440 --> 35:32.360
Master...

802
36:19.440 --> 36:20.230
Gensheng,

803
36:21.400 --> 36:23.260
what exactly happened

804
36:23.800 --> 36:25.360
that night 6 years ago?

805
36:25.760 --> 36:27.040
I don't know.

806
36:27.630 --> 36:29.380
I don't know.

807
36:29.440 --> 36:30.550
You're lying.

808
36:31.670 --> 36:33.400
You know everything.

809
36:34.000 --> 36:36.200
Yin Jie rarely associated with anyone.

810
36:36.230 --> 36:37.400
And no one

811
36:37.630 --> 36:38.830
would visit his house

812
36:38.840 --> 36:41.000
in the middle of the night.

813
36:41.110 --> 36:42.960
Come on, have a bite.

814
36:47.590 --> 36:48.800
But now,

815
36:49.000 --> 36:51.190
everyone in Gutan County knows

816
36:51.280 --> 36:52.740
everything that happened

817
36:52.800 --> 36:53.800
in this courtyard

818
36:53.810 --> 36:55.060
that night.

819
36:55.550 --> 36:56.670
Papa is back.

820
36:56.800 --> 36:57.590
Coming.

821
37:04.710 --> 37:06.510
How did everyone come to know?

822
37:09.320 --> 37:10.110
Unless

823
37:10.760 --> 37:13.030
someone had been in this courtyard

824
37:13.510 --> 37:15.640
and witnessed everything firsthand.

825
37:18.670 --> 37:20.760
Yin Jie wanted to avenge his wife and son

826
37:20.760 --> 37:22.320
by killing the village ruffians.

827
37:22.320 --> 37:24.030
But how did he know

828
37:24.480 --> 37:26.480
who the culprits were?

829
37:27.710 --> 37:29.230
Who told him?

830
37:35.760 --> 37:36.550
Gensheng,

831
37:37.070 --> 37:38.190
that night,

832
37:38.710 --> 37:40.000
you happened to hear your master's wife

833
37:40.000 --> 37:41.990
crying for help from the room.

834
37:42.480 --> 37:43.840
-But at that time, -Let go of me!

835
37:43.840 --> 37:45.460
you were too scared

836
37:45.670 --> 37:47.250
to go in and save her.

837
37:48.320 --> 37:49.510
Instead, you just watched

838
37:49.510 --> 37:50.550
those villains

839
37:51.230 --> 37:53.590
assault your master's wife.

840
37:59.030 --> 38:00.630
You saw everything.

841
38:01.670 --> 38:03.000
They violated

842
38:04.000 --> 38:05.670
your master's wife

843
38:06.030 --> 38:08.340
and brutally murdered your master's

844
38:08.440 --> 38:10.480
3-year-old son.

845
38:11.190 --> 38:12.390
I didn't kill anyone.

846
38:12.880 --> 38:13.940
I didn't kill them.

847
38:14.880 --> 38:15.970
They did it.

848
38:16.480 --> 38:17.680
I didn't kill anyone.

849
38:18.670 --> 38:19.480
They did it.

850
38:19.480 --> 38:20.480
They killed them!

851
38:20.630 --> 38:22.480
They were all filthy scoundrels,

852
38:22.480 --> 38:23.540
wicked to the core!

853
38:23.670 --> 38:24.480
They deserved to die!

854
38:24.480 --> 38:25.030
They deserved to die...

855
38:25.030 --> 38:26.590
You didn't kill the family.

856
38:26.590 --> 38:27.960
The villains did.

857
38:28.280 --> 38:29.840
So they all deserved to die.

858
38:31.030 --> 38:32.270
But is that really

859
38:32.840 --> 38:34.190
what happened?

860
38:37.670 --> 38:39.670
We've finished examining the remains of Qin,

861
38:39.670 --> 38:40.960
Yin Jie's wife.

862
39:02.280 --> 39:03.610
Although only her bones

863
39:03.620 --> 39:04.670
remain after all these years,

864
39:04.670 --> 39:05.980
the marks on them

865
39:06.010 --> 39:07.310
still show

866
39:08.000 --> 39:09.030
multiple stab wounds

867
39:09.030 --> 39:10.710
to the ribs made by a sharp blade.

868
39:10.710 --> 39:12.840
However, those wounds were not the cause of death.

869
39:12.840 --> 39:14.480
I carefully examined the throat.

870
39:14.480 --> 39:15.480
The hyoid bone is fractured,

871
39:15.480 --> 39:16.320
clearly

872
39:16.350 --> 39:18.080
from forceful strangulation.

873
39:20.510 --> 39:22.040
She was strangled to death.

874
39:22.760 --> 39:23.550
Gensheng,

875
39:24.440 --> 39:25.970
now that it has come to this,

876
39:26.110 --> 39:27.670
what else do you have to say?

877
39:32.320 --> 39:33.720
You resented your master

878
39:35.000 --> 39:36.150
for refusing to

879
39:36.150 --> 39:37.190
teach you

880
39:37.190 --> 39:38.850
"The Magpie Bridge Reunion."

881
39:39.230 --> 39:40.030
So,

882
39:41.110 --> 39:42.910
you kept waiting for your chance

883
39:43.630 --> 39:44.840
to take the Cowherd and the Weaver Girl shadow puppets

884
39:44.840 --> 39:45.960
for yourself.

885
39:47.190 --> 39:48.630
Until that night...

886
39:51.440 --> 39:52.440
Who are you?

887
39:52.510 --> 39:53.510
Let go of me!

888
39:53.920 --> 39:54.760
Let go!

889
39:55.670 --> 39:56.480
Let go!

890
39:56.590 --> 39:57.670
Let go of me!

891
40:13.280 --> 40:14.250
Yin Jie won't

892
40:14.280 --> 40:15.480
come after us for this, will he?

893
40:15.480 --> 40:16.110
What's there to fear?

894
40:16.110 --> 40:16.840
What can a shadow puppeteer

895
40:16.840 --> 40:17.880
do?

896
40:18.280 --> 40:19.070
-Besides, -Yeah.

897
40:19.070 --> 40:20.480
who would know it was us?

898
41:12.420 --> 41:13.970
[The Magpie Bridge Reunion Score]

899
41:24.960 --> 41:25.760
Gensheng.

900
41:25.920 --> 41:26.670
Gensheng,

901
41:26.670 --> 41:27.590
I'm begging you.

902
41:27.590 --> 41:29.070
Please, please

903
41:29.070 --> 41:29.880
save me.

904
41:30.400 --> 41:31.440
Please.

905
41:31.480 --> 41:32.810
If he won't pass it to me,

906
41:32.840 --> 41:34.030
I'll take it myself!

907
41:34.710 --> 41:36.190
What secret technique

908
41:36.800 --> 41:37.590
is hidden

909
41:37.590 --> 41:38.920
in this pair of puppets?

910
41:39.440 --> 41:40.640
He wouldn't pass it on

911
41:40.920 --> 41:42.110
because he was afraid I'd surpass him

912
41:42.110 --> 41:43.600
one day!

913
41:43.800 --> 41:45.030
For years, I've bowed

914
41:45.030 --> 41:46.880
and scraped and let you order me around.

915
41:46.880 --> 41:48.620
I've had enough!

916
41:48.710 --> 41:49.440
Let go!

917
41:49.440 --> 41:51.190
Gensheng, please...

918
41:51.280 --> 41:52.070
Let go.

919
41:52.280 --> 41:53.250
Let go!

920
41:53.360 --> 41:54.110
No...

921
41:54.110 --> 41:55.110
I'm begging you.

922
41:55.110 --> 41:56.070
Please save me.

923
41:57.320 --> 41:58.190
Gensheng...

924
42:03.760 --> 42:04.510
Please,

925
42:04.510 --> 42:05.670
I'm begging you.

926
42:09.230 --> 42:10.380
You won't let go?

927
42:10.440 --> 42:11.720
You won't let go, huh?

928
42:14.440 --> 42:15.640
You won't let go, huh?

929
42:29.360 --> 42:30.150
Afterward,

930
42:30.840 --> 42:31.780
when the county office inventoried

931
42:31.780 --> 42:33.240
the victims' belongings,

932
42:34.070 --> 42:35.730
they naturally failed to find

933
42:35.840 --> 42:38.170
that pair of shadow puppets you had taken.

934
42:38.670 --> 42:40.070
Now I just want to ask you,

935
42:40.670 --> 42:41.480
Gensheng.

936
42:42.590 --> 42:44.070
Did you find the secret

937
42:44.440 --> 42:46.700
your master hid and refused to pass down?

938
42:50.800 --> 42:51.930
Preparing the hide,

939
42:52.710 --> 42:53.840
scraping it smooth,

940
42:54.230 --> 42:56.230
drawing the design, transferring it onto the hide,

941
42:56.230 --> 42:57.800
carving, coloring,

942
42:58.110 --> 42:59.910
conditioning, and assembling.

943
43:00.070 --> 43:01.670
What on earth was different?

944
43:03.440 --> 43:05.770
Actually, there was no difference at all.

945
43:05.920 --> 43:06.900
They were just

946
43:06.930 --> 43:09.280
a pair of ordinary shadow puppets.

947
43:10.070 --> 43:11.070
My master had long

948
43:11.070 --> 43:12.440
since taught me everything

949
43:12.440 --> 43:14.400
he could.

950
43:17.110 --> 43:18.440
There was just one thing

951
43:19.200 --> 43:20.670
I couldn't understand.

952
43:21.030 --> 43:22.590
Why, of all plays, wouldn't he

953
43:22.590 --> 43:25.670
teach me "The Magpie Bridge Reunion"?

954
43:26.190 --> 43:27.000
Gensheng,

955
43:27.920 --> 43:30.280
do you think Yin Jie's "The Magpie Bridge Reunion"

956
43:30.280 --> 43:30.880
was just about

957
43:30.880 --> 43:32.920
the love story of the Cowherd and the Weaver Girl?

958
43:32.920 --> 43:34.590
You were too young back then.

959
43:34.670 --> 43:35.840
You hadn't yet experienced

960
43:35.840 --> 43:37.800
the full range of human emotions.

961
43:38.880 --> 43:40.840
You had no one to give your true love to,

962
43:40.840 --> 43:43.190
nor had you ever suffered the pain of longing for someone!

963
43:43.190 --> 43:44.670
Without experiencing separation,

964
43:44.670 --> 43:46.600
how could you understand reunion?

965
43:46.920 --> 43:47.990
And how could you convey

966
43:47.990 --> 43:49.650
the true meaning of this song?

967
43:50.440 --> 43:51.590
Your master

968
43:51.920 --> 43:53.850
wanted to wait until you were older

969
43:54.110 --> 43:55.320
and had experienced more of life

970
43:55.320 --> 43:57.190
before passing the play on to you!

971
44:09.400 --> 44:10.190
Yu'er.

972
44:10.800 --> 44:11.800
I always feel

973
44:12.840 --> 44:13.590
that something is missing

974
44:13.590 --> 44:15.070
from this Weaver Girl.

975
44:16.070 --> 44:17.000
Let me see.

976
44:27.510 --> 44:28.440
I have an idea.

977
44:46.630 --> 44:47.550
Brilliant.

978
44:47.880 --> 44:48.670
Yu'er,

979
44:49.030 --> 44:50.000
you know what?

980
44:50.590 --> 44:52.590
Watching Gensheng grow up day by day

981
44:53.000 --> 44:54.590
fills my heart with joy.

982
44:55.670 --> 44:56.920
I'll pass on every skill

983
44:56.920 --> 44:58.070
I know,

984
44:59.000 --> 45:01.260
including "The Magpie Bridge Reunion."

985
45:01.360 --> 45:02.160
In the future,

986
45:02.440 --> 45:03.590
our family

987
45:03.840 --> 45:05.640
will perform on stage together.

988
45:16.070 --> 45:17.030
Mrs. Yin...

989
45:47.440 --> 45:48.400
Master.

990
45:49.440 --> 45:50.610
Mrs. Yin...

991
45:51.840 --> 45:53.160
I...

992
45:54.070 --> 45:55.840
was wrong...

993
45:58.670 --> 45:59.840
Take him back to the county jail

994
45:59.840 --> 46:00.840
and deal with him according to the law.

995
46:00.840 --> 46:01.590
-Yes. -Yes.

996
46:02.990 --> 46:03.800
Move!
